# Copy to .env (which git ignores) and fill in. Never commit real keys.

# --- FalkorDB (defaults shown; only change them if your database runs elsewhere) ---
# FALKORDB_HOST=localhost
# FALKORDB_PORT=6379

# --- Optional LLM for tool selection --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Any OpenAI-compatible chat-completions API with tool calling works. All three variables are required;
# if any is missing Quorum runs in "Keywords only" mode, which answers everything deterministically.
# Even when configured, the LLM is used only after `python -m scripts.llm_smoke` has passed for this exact
# provider and model (it writes evals/llm_smoke.json). The LLM never sets verdicts and never writes Cypher.
#
# Example: OpenRouter (https://openrouter.ai). Pick a model whose page lists "tools" as a supported parameter.
#   LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1
#   LLM_API_KEY=<your OpenRouter key>
#   LLM_MODEL=<model id, e.g. nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free>
#
# Example: Google Gemini through its OpenAI-compatible endpoint
#   LLM_BASE_URL=https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/openai/
#   LLM_API_KEY=<your Gemini API key>
#   LLM_MODEL=gemini-2.5-flash
LLM_BASE_URL=
LLM_API_KEY=
LLM_MODEL=
